 intensities without the expected 'thickening' of the blood—a trait evolved from millennia spent as high-altitude foragers and herders in thin air where oxygen is a scarce commodity.\nMeanwhile, Ys possesses a distinct structural advantage in their lower leg mass; their measurably more slender calves and ankles act as a 'lighter pendulum,' requiring significantly less energy to swing forward over tens of thousands of strides. This mechanical trait was selected for by the daily survival routine of managing cattle herds across the rolling hills and dry heat of the Rift Valley, where walking or running 15–30km daily was the baseline for children and adults alike.\nTogether, these ancestries hold a total 'monopoly' over Sport Z. The brilliance of Xs is personified by A, who famously broke 27 world records during their career. The mechanical perfection of Ys led to a historic milestone when B became the first human in history to break the two-hour barrier in this discipline.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:49:38Z", "username": "Dhruva", "text": "Marathon", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:49:39Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Kenya, Ethiopia", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:49:39Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Kipchoge", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:49:40Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Gabersalesi", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:49:43Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Kipchoge", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:49:45Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Gabrielsesie", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "